  "version": "1",
  "text": "This outfit is a powerful statement of confident professionalism. It anchors your day with a sleek black suit that offers an effortless, streamlined silhouette, while the rich chocolate blazer introduces warmth and texture to elevate your office presence without sacrificing polish.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Leave the chocolate blazer open to create a clean vertical line from shoulder to hip, elongating your figure as you move between meetings."
  ],
