  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#399·30",
      "text": "This black suit delivers a sharp, tailored silhouette that reads as polished and modern. The deep, matte finish of the fabric keeps your look grounded and professional for any part of your workday."
    },
    {
      "n": "#565·32",
      "text": "This gold and pearl brooch adds a touch of classic elegance to the neckline. Its structured shape brings a focal point to your upper body without adding clutter, perfect for catching attention at desk or meetings."
    },
    {
      "n": "#428·10",
      "text": "These black ballet flats offer quiet comfort that keeps up with long days in the office. Their minimalist profile blends seamlessly with your suit, ensuring you can move through the day without breaking stride."
    },
    {
      "n": "#539·06",
      "text": "This red clutch serves as a striking pop of color against the neutral palette of your ensemble. Its sleek, minimalist lines maintain the outfit's sophisticated edge while adding a moment of unexpected energy to your look."
    },
    {
      "n": "#454·12",
      "text": "The chocolate blazer brings warmth and richness to your professional style. Its soft fabric contrasts beautifully with the sleekness of the black suit underneath, creating depth and texture that makes your office wear feel intentionally layered."
    }
  ]
}
